---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="MCP Server — SessionFS" activeNav="features" description="MCP server lets AI agents search past sessions and read project context.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative pt-32 sm:pt-40 pb-16 px-5 noise">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <div class="fade-up inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-mono text-muted-dim mb-6">
        <a href="/features/" class="hover:text-brand transition-colors">Features</a>
        <span>&#47;</span>
        <span class="text-txt">MCP Server</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="fade-up font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-6">
        Your AI remembers
      </h1>
      <p class="fade-up text-lg sm:text-xl text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto">
        The MCP server lets AI agents search your past sessions and read project context during conversations. One command to install.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="grad-divider"></div>

  <!-- Terminal -->
  <section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 px-5 noise">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="fade-up relative">
        <div class="hero-glow"></div>
        <div class="term relative z-10">
          <div class="term-bar">
            <div class="term-dot bg-[#ff5f57]"></div>
            <div class="term-dot bg-[#febc2e]"></div>
            <div class="term-dot bg-[#28c840]"></div>
            <span class="ml-3 text-muted-dim text-[13px] font-mono">mcp install</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 font-mono text-sm space-y-1">
            <div><span class="text-muted-dim">$</span> <span class="text-accent">sfs mcp install --for claude-code</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted">MCP server configured for Claude Code.</div>
            <div class="text-muted">Restart Claude Code to activate.</div>
            <div class="mt-4 text-muted-dim">106 tools available to your AI agent:</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-muted-dim">Session tools (10):</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">search_sessions</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Search past sessions</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_session_context</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Full conversation from a session</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">list_recent_sessions</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Browse recent work</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">find_related_sessions</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Find by file or error</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_session_summary</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Structured session summary</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_audit_report</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Trust audit report</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_session_provenance</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Which rules instructed a session</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">ask_session_helper</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Ask the helper over sessions you can read</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_session_retrieval_log</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— What an agent retrieved during a session</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">rename_session</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Rename a session or set its alias</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted-dim">Knowledge read (9):</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_project_context</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Full wiki: overview + pages + concepts</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_context_section</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— One section of the context doc</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_wiki_page</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— One wiki page in full</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_wiki_page_history</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Revision history with persona / ticket attribution</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">search_project_knowledge</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Search knowledge entries</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">list_knowledge_entries</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Filter by type / class / freshness</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_knowledge_entry</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— One entry's full record</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_knowledge_health</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Pending / compiled counts</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">ask_project</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Q&A with sources_cited</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted-dim">Knowledge write (8):</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">add_knowledge</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Save a discovery / decision / pattern</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">update_wiki_page</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Create or update a wiki page</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">list_wiki_pages</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Browse wiki structure</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">compile_knowledge_base</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Trigger a compile pass</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">dismiss_knowledge_entry</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Dismiss a stale or wrong entry (audited)</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">update_entry_confidence</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Raise or lower an entry's confidence</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">promote_entry</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Promote a note to a claim</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">promote_eligible_entries</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Promote every eligible note at once</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted-dim">Rules (2):</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_rules</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Canonical project rules</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_compiled_rules</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Compiled rules per tool</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted-dim">Personas (7) — <span class="text-accent">Pro+</span>:</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">list_personas</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Project personas</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_persona</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— One persona's full content</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">create_persona</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Define a new project persona</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">update_persona</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Edit a persona</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">delete_persona</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Retire a persona</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">assume_persona</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Tag captured sessions with this persona</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">forget_persona</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Clear the active persona bundle</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted-dim">Tickets (15) — <span class="text-accent">Team+</span>:</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">list_tickets</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Filter by status / assignee</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_ticket</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Ticket detail + dependencies</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">create_ticket</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Open new ticket (acceptance criteria required for agents)</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">update_ticket</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Edit a ticket (diff comment + audit)</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">approve_ticket</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Approve a suggested ticket</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">start_ticket</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Atomic claim + compiled context + bundle write</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">complete_ticket</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Send to review, clear owned bundle</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">resolve_ticket</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Mark done from review</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">assign_persona</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Set the persona on a ticket</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">escalate_ticket</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Audit comment + raise priority</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">add_ticket_comment</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Slack-like thread</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">list_ticket_comments</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Page through a ticket's comments</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_ticket_review_state</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Open findings + last review verdict</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">watch_ticket</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Follow a ticket to be told when it changes</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_ticket_updates</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Poll what changed on followed tickets</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted-dim">Agent runs (4) — <span class="text-accent">Team+</span>:</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">create_agent_run</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Track a persona run, manual or CI</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">complete_agent_run</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Record findings, evaluate fail-on policy</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">replay_agent_run</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Re-run with an edited prompt or context</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">list_agent_runs</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Browse runs by persona / status / ticket</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted-dim">Agent feedback (3) — <span class="text-accent">Team+</span>:</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">record_agent_feedback</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Record how an agent run or ticket turned out</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">list_agent_feedback</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Browse feedback records</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_agent_feedback_summary</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Counts by type and verdict</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted-dim">Handoffs (8) — <span class="text-accent">Pro+</span>:</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">create_handoff</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Hand work to a teammate or team</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">claim_handoff</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Claim a handoff with its ticket and context</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_handoff</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— One handoff in full</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">list_inbox_handoffs</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Handoffs sent to you</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">list_sent_handoffs</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Handoffs you sent</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">revoke_handoff</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Withdraw a handoff</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">decline_handoff</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Decline a handoff</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">add_handoff_comment</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Comment on a handoff</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted-dim">Checkpoints (3):</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">checkpoint_session</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Snapshot a session</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">list_checkpoints</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— A session's checkpoints</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">fork_session</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Branch a new session from a checkpoint</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted-dim">Work queues (6):</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">create_work_queue</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Aim an agent at a queue of tickets</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_work_queue</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Queue config + progress</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">list_work_queues</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Browse a project's queues</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">set_work_queue_status</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Pause / resume / archive</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">run_work_queue_step</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Heartbeat: one bounded directive per wake</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">complete_work_queue_step</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Durably advance the queue</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted-dim">Skills marketplace (10):</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">search_skill_marketplace</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Search skill and plugin packages</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_marketplace_package</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Hash, license, risk, compatibility and install disclosure</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">diff_marketplace_versions</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— What changed between two versions (text, code or widening)</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">preview_marketplace_skill</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Untrusted instruction preview</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">load_marketplace_skill</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Load an approved instruction-only skill</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">request_skill_install</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Ask a project admin to approve an install</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_skill_install_request</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— One install request</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">list_skill_install_requests</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Project install requests</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-accent">cancel_skill_install_request</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Cancel a pending request</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_skill_policy</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Your org's skills policy, per tool</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-muted-dim">Project groups (15):</div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">search_group_knowledge</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Search claims across a group's projects you can read</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">get_group_context</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— The group's compiled overview</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">ask_group</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Research a question across a group, with sources</span></div>
            <div class="text-txt">&bull; <span class="text-brand">update_project_group</span> <span class="text-muted-dim">— Rename a group or turn its knowledge compile on</span></div>
            <div class="text-muted-dim">&hellip; plus list, create, delete, add/remove projects, members, grant/revoke access, compile</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="grad-divider"></div>

  <!-- Sub-feature cards -->
  <section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 px-5 bg-surface/50 noise">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="fade-up font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12">What the MCP server gives you</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">

        <div class="glass fade-up p-6">
          <div class="mb-3"><svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="#f0c040" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold mb-2">One-command install</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-base leading-relaxed">Works with Claude Code, Cursor, and Copilot. Adds SessionFS to your tool's MCP config file automatically — no manual JSON editing.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass fade-up p-6">
          <div class="mb-3"><svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="#4f9cf7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0113.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375H8.25m0 12.75h7.5m-7.5 3H12M10.5 2.25H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 00-9-9z"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold mb-2">Project context</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-base leading-relaxed">Share architecture decisions, coding conventions, and API contracts with every AI agent on your team. One document per repo, always current.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass fade-up p-6">
          <div class="mb-3"><svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="#3ddc84" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 008.716-6.747M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 01-8.716-6.747M12 21c2.485 0 4.5-4.03 4.5-9S14.485 3 12 3m0 18c-2.485 0-4.5-4.03-4.5-9S9.515 3 12 3m0 0a8.997 8.997 0 017.843 4.582M12 3a8.997 8.997 0 00-7.843 4.582m15.686 0A11.953 11.953 0 0112 10.5c-2.998 0-5.74-1.1-7.843-2.918m15.686 0A8.959 8.959 0 0121 12c0 .778-.099 1.533-.284 2.253m0 0A17.919 17.919 0 0112 16.5c-3.162 0-6.133-.815-8.716-2.247m0 0A9.015 9.015 0 013 12c0-1.605.42-3.113 1.157-4.418"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold mb-2">Local, No Network Needed</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-base leading-relaxed">Local MCP server on stdio for desktop tools — no network required.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="grad-divider"></div>

  <!-- How agents use it -->
  <section class="relative py-20 px-5 noise">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start gap-12">
      <div class="lg:w-1/2 fade-up">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-4">How agents use session memory</h2>
        <p class="text-muted text-lg mb-6 leading-relaxed">When you start a new session, your AI agent can automatically search for related past sessions and load their context — so it already knows what you tried last time.</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-base mb-6 leading-relaxed">The <span class="font-mono text-accent text-sm">find_related_sessions</span> tool maps file paths and error strings to previous sessions. If you're debugging the same file you touched last week, the agent knows.</p>
        <a href="/mcp/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand text-white font-semibold rounded-lg px-6 py-3 hover:brightness-110 transition">
          Read the MCP docs
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:w-1/2 fade-up">
        <div class="term">
          <div class="term-bar">
            <div class="term-dot bg-[#ff5f57]"></div>
            <div class="term-dot bg-[#febc2e]"></div>
            <div class="term-dot bg-[#28c840]"></div>
            <span class="ml-3 text-muted-dim text-[13px] font-mono">agent using MCP</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 font-mono text-sm space-y-3">
            <div>
              <div class="text-muted-dim text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Agent calls MCP tool</div>
              <div class="bg-bg/60 rounded p-2.5 text-sm">
                <span class="text-brand">find_related_sessions</span>
                <span class="text-muted-dim">(</span><span class="text-accent">"tokens.py"</span><span class="text-muted-dim">)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t border-border pt-3">
              <div class="text-muted-dim text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">SessionFS returns</div>
              <div class="text-muted text-sm">ses_abc — Debug auth middleware (2 days ago)</div>
              <div class="text-muted text-sm">ses_d2e — JWT token refresh fix (5 days ago)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t border-border pt-3">
              <div class="text-muted-dim text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Agent says</div>
              <div class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">"I found 2 related sessions. The last time you worked on tokens.py, you extended the expiry window and added redis for caching..."</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="grad-divider"></div>

</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach(e => { if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('visible'); } });
  }, { threshold: 0.1 });
  document.querySelectorAll('.fade-up').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
</script>
